            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Airline stocks slip on continued delays, Beyond Meat stock falls",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> recaps three of the top stories on Wall Street as part of <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) and CoreWeave (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWV\">CRWV</a>) are some of the tech stocks in the red during Tuesday's session.</p>\n<p>Airline stocks, like Delta Air Lines (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DAL\">DAL</a>), United (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UAL\">UAL</a>), and American (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAL\">AAL</a>), are under pressure as flight delays are expected to continue beyond the government shutdown.</p>\n<p>Beyond Meat (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYND\">BYND</a>) stock tumbles after issuing a weak outlook.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
